! EOM-CCSD def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Canonical EOM-CCSD in ORCA, SERIAL/low-mem. Isolates: (a) ORCA-EOM vs Q-Chem-EOM = code check,
# (b) ORCA-STEOM vs ORCA-EOM = pure STEOM method error (same code).
%maxcore 26000
%pal nprocs 1 end
%mdci NRoots 3  MaxIter 200 end
* xyzfile 0 1 neutral_chromophore.xyz
